# Holds a generated APP_KEY. This repository is public, so the file itself
# stays local — `.env.testing.example` documents how to recreate it, which is
# what preserves the "all testing runs against the dedicated testing database,
# never dev and never production" rule.
/.env.testing

# Internal work log: hours, time estimates and delivery notes kept for
# management reporting. Business record, not source code, and not something to
# publish in a public repository.
